desc(
	mode: "ssa"
	language: "python"
	title: "数据流：Python SQL Injection: User Input Concatenated Into Query"
	title_zh: "数据流：Python SQL 注入：用户输入拼接进查询语句"
	type: vuln
	level: ""
	rule_id: "ssa-python-sql-concat"
	risk: "sql-injection"
	cwe: "CWE-89"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 漏洞描述
Web 请求参数经 `+`、f-string 等方式拼接进 SQL 文本后交给数据库执行。攻击者可注入 `' OR '1'='1` 等片段改变查询语义。

### 检测方式
先定位包含 `SELECT ... FROM` 的字符串常量，再沿其使用边找到字符串拼接结果，并确认拼接结果可达 Flask/Django 请求参数。参数化查询（`?`、`%s` 占位符 + 参数元组）不经过字符串拼接，不告警。

### 风险类型
sql-injection
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
使用 DB-API 参数化查询，把用户输入作为第二个参数传入：

```python
cursor.execute("SELECT id, name FROM users WHERE name = ?", (name,))
```

不要用 `+`、f-string 或 `%` 把请求参数拼进 SQL 文本。无法参数化的标识符（表名、列名）应使用白名单映射。
SOLUTION
	reference: <<<REFERENCE
[CWE-89: Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in an SQL Command](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/89.html)
REFERENCE
	alert_min: 1
)

request.args.get(* as $src)
request.form.get(* as $src)
request.values.get(* as $src)
request.GET.get(* as $src)
request.POST.get(* as $src)
request.get_json(* as $src)

*?{have: /(?i)select\s+.+?\s+from/} as $const
$const<getUsers()>?{opcode: add} as $query
$query?{<self> #{include: <<<CODE
* & $src as $__next__
CODE
}->} as $hit

alert $hit for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Python SQL Injection: User Input Concatenated Into Query",
	title_zh: "Python SQL 注入：用户输入拼接进查询语句",
	risk: "sql-injection",
}

desc(
	lang: python
	alert_high: 1
	'file://unsafe_sql_concat.py': <<<UNSAFE
from flask import request

def users():
    name = request.args.get("name", "")
    query = "SELECT id, name FROM users WHERE name = '" + name + "'"
    return query
UNSAFE
	'safefile://safe_sql_concat.py': <<<SAFE
from flask import request

def users():
    name = request.args.get("name", "")
    query = "SELECT id, name FROM users WHERE name = ?"
    return query, (name,)
SAFE
)
